; Solves cleanly in cavern; the scanner seeds declination in degrees only,
; so it reads this file with one warning about the declination units.
; The nested block gives the attach a derived node below the owner.
*begin ReadWarning
*declination 2 grads
*fix A1 0 0 0
*data normal from to tape compass clino
A1 A2 5.0 0 0
A2 A3 5.0 90 0
*begin Inner
*data normal from to tape compass clino
B1 B2 4.0 180 0
*end Inner
*equate A3 Inner.B1
*end ReadWarning
